Suppose that you want to push version 3.4.6 of your package to all orgs. You’ve already identified the orgs eligible for the upgrade by using MetadataPackageVersion and created the push request using PackagePushRequest. Now let’s write some code to create a push job for each eligible org. This code sample uses the Web Services Connector (WSC). Checking the Status of a Push Job

